<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Muggendorfer Gebürg cave-and-karst circuit — Durchs Muggendorfer Gebürg</name><desc>From the Naturpark information centre in Muggendorf, climb the Mehlbeerensteig to the Hohlen Berg and plateau, visit Riesenburg, continue through Engelhardsberg past Quackenschloss, and return through Oswaldhöhle. Walk the complete cave-visiting circuit April–September; seasonal bat-protection rules restrict other cave entry October–March.

